+      "reason": "Reviewed `prli_authenticator_account_email`, `prli_authenticator_secret_token`, and `prli_authenticator_site_uuid`. The store leg in `process_connect()` only executes when `prli-connect=true`, a valid nonce is present, and `PrliUtils::is_authorized()` passes (`plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAuthenticatorController.php:78`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAuthenticatorController.php:83`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAuthenticatorController.php:88`). The option values are sanitized before storage (`plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAuthenticatorController.php:92`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAuthenticatorController.php:93`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAuthenticatorController.php:109`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAuthenticatorController.php:113`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAuthenticatorController.php:121`). Later reads feed JWT generation, remote requests, and connection-URL branching (`plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAuthenticatorController.php:174`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAuthenticatorController.php:175`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAuthenticatorController.php:218`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/views/admin/payments/options.php:12`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliLinksController.php:1272`). Refutation attempt: no matching HTML or SQL sink was found for these stored values."
