+      "reason": "Reviewed `pl_review_prompt_removed`, `pl_review_prompt_delay`, `pl_dismiss_upgrade_header`, `prli_customer_portal_notice_dismissed`, and the dynamic `prli_dismiss_notice_*` keys. Store legs are nonce-gated and authorization-gated in `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliReviewNoticeController.php:15`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliReviewNoticeController.php:19`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAppController.php:69`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAppController.php:73`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAppController.php:132`, and `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliStripeController.php:1140`. Matching reads are only boolean/timestamp checks controlling notice visibility (`plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliReviewNoticeController.php:54`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliReviewNoticeController.php:60`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliAppController.php:86`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliStripeController.php:979`, `plugins/pretty-link/app/controllers/PrliStripeConnectController.php:289`). Refutation attempt: dynamic-key review did not produce a dangerous load sink, so there is no defensible stored XSS or second-order SQLi conclusion."
